  "title": "HEIDMAR MARITIME HOLDINGS CORP. ANNOUNCES TRANSITION IN CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER ROLE",
  "summary": "Athens / New York, 1st June 2026 – Heidmar Maritime Holdings Corp. (the “Company” or “Heidmar”) (NASDAQ: HMR) today announced a transition in its finance leadership. Mrs Niki Fotiou no longer holds the position of Chief Financial Officer, effective 31st May 2026. Read More",
